    "CoiStatement": "The authors declare no conflict of interest. J. Neary and S.E. Goodwin are the treating physicians of the patient, L.B. Cohen clinically diagnosed and treated the patients from the control groups and M.G. Neuman designed the study and performed all the laboratory analyses of the entire study. The founding sponsors had no role in the design of the study; in the collection, analyses, or interpretation of data; in the writing of the manuscript, and in the decision to publish the results.",
    "Article": {
